  "details": "In order to go into all public and other lobbies you must hit user. Visitors can only make and travel to visitor worlds like a community quarantine. in order to integrate they must hit user. Visitors can be brought out with friends and given guest badges that tell who brought them out, and if any spam, annoyance, or crasher activity comes from it, both accounts get the moderation.\nUser+ can go to visitor/new instances and interact as well, mostly to meet up with friends they're bringing in to VRC. Having it work like a +1 system at a party could really reduce the nuisances of kids running around, hurling slurs, and maybe even reduce the 8-12 year-olds that violate TOS.",
